  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allowing admin/moderators to write a message in-game to send an announcement/notification only within the current group instance. This will be a useful feature to reach out to players a great distance away or group up players who are scattered for something like a group picture. This way, admins and mods don't need to go to the website and post an announcement, and the message only reaches the people it concerns. If there are multiple instances, it'll be more direct, and if there are people not interested in that day's event, members won't have a lot of clutter in their notifications.",
